    ["Blasts the target for Fire damage."] = "Sprænger målet for Ildskade.",
    ["Bleeding out from a vicious wound."] = "Blør ud fra et ondskabsfuldt sår.",
    ["Bleeding profusely until fully healed."] = "Blør voldsomt, indtil du er fuldt helbredt.",
    ["Bleeding, for testing purposes."] = "Blødende, udelukkende til test.",
    ["Bleeding."] = "Blødende.",
    ["Blending in with the taller races."] = "Smelter ind blandt de højere racer.",
    ["Bless the grenade with the Light."] = "Velsign granaten med Lyset.",
    ["Blessed by Cenarius."] = "Velsignet af Cenarus.",
    ["Blessed by the Loa of Bats. Heal yourself for 5% of all damage dealt."] = "Velsignet af Flagermus-loaerne. Helbred dig selv for 5% af al forvoldt skade.",
    ["Blessed by the Loa of Panthers. Gain stealth and bonus damage on next attack or spell after being out of combat for 5 seconds."] = "Velsignet af Panter-loaerne. Få snigskjul og bonusskade ved næste angreb eller besværgelse, efter at have været uden for kamp i 5 sekunder.",
    ["Blessed by the Loa of Snakes.  Chance on attack or spell cast to deal nature damage to all nearby enemies."] = "Velsignet af Slange-loaerne. Chance for at angreb eller besværgelse påfører naturskade til alle fjender i nærheden.",
    ["Blessed by the Loa of Spiders. Chance on attack or spell cast to summon spawns of Shadra."] = "Velsignet af Edderkop-loaerne. Chance for at angreb eller besværgelse tilkalder Skyggras afkom.",
    ["Blessed by the Loa of Tigers. Attacks and spells invoke Shirvallah to increase haste for you and your nearby allies."] = "Velsignet af Tiger-loaerne. Angreb og besværgelser påkalder Sjirvallah for at øge hastigheden for dig og dine allierede i nærheden.",
    ["Blessing from the Holy Spring of Stranglethorn Vale."] = "Velsignelse fra den hellige kilde i Kvælerdorn-dalen.",
    ["Blinded and disoriented."] = "Blændet og desorienteret.",
    ["Blinded."] = "Blændet.",
    ["Blinking."] = "Hopper.",
