    ["Combines with Gri'lek's Blood, Renataki's Tooth, Wushoolay's Mane, and Hazza'rah's Dream Thread to form a powerful charm."] = "Kombineres med Grimleks Blod, Rendetakis' Tand, Vushulays Manke og Hazzarahs Drømmetråd for at danne en kraftfuld amulet.",
    ["Combo points will be transferred to the next target hit by this Rogue's abilities."] = "Kombinationspoint vil blive overført til næste mål, der rammes af denne Skurks evner.",
