    ["Consume two Un'Goro Soil samples and a Packet of Tharlendris seeds to make an Evergreen Herb Casing."] = "Fortær to Un'Goro-jordprøver og en Pose Tharlendris-frø for at lave et Evergrønt Urtehylster.",
    ["Consumed by the fury of Illidan: 1400 Attack Power bonus versus Demons. 20% bonus chance to hit. 30% melee haste."] = "Fortæret af Illidans vrede: +1400 bonus til Angrebskraft over for Dæmoner. 20% bonus til angrebschance. 30% nærkampshastighed.",
