    ["Imbue a piece of chest armor for 60 minutes so it has a 5% chance per hit of giving you 25 points of damage absorption."] = "Indgyd et stykke kisterustning i 60 minutter, så den har 5% chance pr. angreb for at give dig 25 point skadeabsorption.",
    ["Imbue a piece of chest armor for 60 minutes so it has a 5% chance per hit of giving you 50 points of damage absorption."] = "Indgyd et stykke kisterustning i 60 minutter, så den har 5% chance pr. angreb for at give dig 50 point skadeabsorption.",
