        {"^Creates% a% mobile% bomb% that% charges% the% nearest% enemy% and% explodes% for% (.-)% fire% damage%.$", {}, "Skaber en mobil bombe, der foretager en ladning mod nærmeste fjende og eksploderer for ", 1, " Ildskade."},
