        {"^Generates% (.-)% Rage% every% (.-)% sec% while% in% combat%,% and% reduces% Rage% loss% while% out% of% combat% by% (.-)%%%.$", {}, "Genererer ", 1, " Vrede hvert ", 2, " sek. i kamp og reducerer tab af Vrede uden for kamp med ", 3, "%."},
