    ["Gives yo"] = {
        {"^Gives% your% Chill% effects% a% chance% to% grant% you% the% Fingers% of% Frost% effect%,% which% treats% your% next% spells% cast% as% if% the% target% were% Frozen%.% % Lasts% (.-)%.$", {1}, "Giver dine Kulde-effekter en chance for at give dig Fingre af Frost-effekten, der behandler dine næste besværgelser støbt, som om målet var Frossen.  Varer ", 1, "."},
