        {"^Increases% the% damage% caused% by% your% Claw%,% Rake%,% Shred%,% Maul%,% and% Swipe% abilities% by% (.-)%%%.$", {}, "Øger skaden fra dine evner Klo, Rive, Strimling, Stødhammer og Fejning med ", 1, "%."},
